#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Ọrụ nchikọta"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Aha ọrụ njikọta iji kọwaa CDP ndị ekwesịrị ịgụpụta."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Họrọ 'gbanye' ma ọ bụrụ na nha a kwesịrị ịbụ akụkụ nke nsonaazụ mkpesa ikpeazụ. Hapụ ya n'enweghị akara ma ọ bụrụ na a ga-eji nha a naanị dị ka mgbakọ nkwado."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Họrọ 'gbanye' ma ọ bụrụ na nha a ga-enwe naanị otu nsonaazụ n'ozuzu kama otu maka Ihe Isi Iyi Data ọ bụla. A ga-egosi nsonaazụ ya<br>n'iche. Jiri nhọrọ a tinyere \"Visible\" = \"off\" ma ọ bụrụ na ị na-achọ nha na-edobe naanị nsonaazụ nwa oge nke a ga-eji mee ihe ọzọ n'ime mgbakọ nke nha ndị ọzọ n'egosighi ndị ọrụ ikpeazụ."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Nhazi"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Na-akọwa ụdị nke a ga-ele data anya dị ka ya."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Izu oke"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Na-akọwa ọnụọgụgụ nkeji desimal ole a ga-egosi maka ọnụọgụgụ nwere ntụpọ."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Okwu Mmalite"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Họrọ ụdị mbido okwu a na-eji hazie nsonaazụ. Site na iji mbido okwu desimalụ a ga-ahazi '1024' ka ọ bụrụ '1.024k' ebe nhọrọ mbido okwu baịnarị na-enye '1ki'. Họrọ 'off' iji gosi data a na-ahazighị, ebe a '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Usoro Ngụkọ"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Nkọwa mgbakọ na mwepụ nke ihe a na-atụ atụ. A kwadoro njikọ niile nke ndị ọrụ na ihe ndị a na-arụ ọrụ edepụtara n'okpuru dị ka iwu mgbakọ na mwepụ si dị. Jiri nkwado okirikiri na nke square gosi okwu gbagwojuru anya na usoro ọrụ."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Akara Mgbakọ & Ihe Mgbakọ"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Pịa n'otu n'ime ndị ọrụ ma ọ bụ ihe mgbakọ e depụtara iji tinye ha na usoro mgbakọ gị. Ndụmọdụ ngwaọrụ ga-egosi gị ozi ndị ọzọ dị ka nkọwa, uru nloghachi, arụmụka na ojiji."

